  "prefLabel": "Pes 506.10 Compliance with Special Permit Conditions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 506.10 Compliance with Special Permit Conditions. In addition to those requirements on a pesticide label and in the administrative rules of the pesticide control board, persons applying pesticides by aerial methods shall also comply with the conditions on the special permit.\n\nSource. #6834, eff 8-26-98; ss by #8131, eff 8-13-04; ss by #10333, eff 5-10-13; ss by #14064, eff 8-22-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pes500.html"
